## Why This Lab Matters

Microsoft Entra ID is central to modern IT environments using Microsoft 365 and cloud-first identity models. This lab demonstrates practical skills required for first-line and junior IT roles, including:

- User account support
- Access control troubleshooting
- Identity security enforcement
- Admin portal navigation
- Cloud authentication investigation

These are core responsibilities in many UK-based IT support and service desk roles.

